<title>UK: GOLF-ALFRED DUNHILL CUP SEMFINAL LINEUP.</title>
<headline>GOLF-ALFRED DUNHILL CUP SEMFINAL LINEUP.</headline>
<dateline>ST ANDREWS, Scotland 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tops seeds the United States will face unseeded Sweden and third-seeded South Africa will take on New Zealand, the seventh seeds, in Sunday morning's semifinals of the Alfred Dunhill Cup.</p>
<p>The four teams won their round robin groups on Saturday. The final will be held on Sunday afternoon.</p>
